{ This is an opposite rosette, third rank type. White plays one main line with two exceptions. }
1. Qf6+ Kc5 (1... Kd5 2. Kd3 Rc6 3. Qd4+ Ke6 4. Ke4 Rd6 { Body Check position } (4... Ke7 5. Qg7+ Kd6 6. Qe5+ Kd7 7. Kd5 Ra6 8. Qg7+ Ke8 9. Qc7 Rf6 10. Ke5 Rg6 { Third rank defense killing position })) 2. Qe5+ Kb4 3. Kd3 { Thorn } 3... Rc6 { Adjacent rosette, cut-off type. } 4. Qb2+ Kc5 5. Qd4+ Kb5 6. Qd5+ Kb6 7. Kd4 { Wedge } *


