{ The first exception to our general principle is this: don't use it when it forces the black king towards the center! If the black king can move towards the center while approaching his rook, instead attack the rook with the white king, and try to pivot the position clock-wise. }
1. Ke3 { Attack the hanging rook } 1... Rd5 2. Qg8+ { Skewer the rook } 2... Ke5 3. Qe8+ Kf6 4. Ke4 { Attack the hanging rook } 4... Rg5 5. Qf8+ Kg6 6. Kf4 { Absolute Seventh extension } *


