1... Rc5+ 2. Kb4 { Attack the hanging rook } 2... Rf5 3. Qc6+ { Give diagonal check } 3... Kd4 4. Qc4+ Ke5 5. Kc5 { take opposition with king } 5... Rf6 6. Qe2+ { black must retreat to the f file } (6. Qd5+ Kf4 7. Kd4 Kg4 8. Ke3 Rf5 9. Qg2+ Kh5 10. Ke4 Rf7 11. Qg3 Rf6 12. Ke5 Rf7 13. Qd3 Kg5 14. Qd8+ Kg6 15. Qg8+ Rg7 16. Qe6+ Kh7 17. Kf5 Rg2 18. Qe4 Rg7 19. Kf6+ Kg8 20. Qa8+ Kh7 21. Qe8 Ra7 22. Qe4+ Kg8 23. Qd5+ Kh7 24. Qh1+ Kg8 25. Qg1+ Kh7 26. Qxa7+ Kh6 27. Qg1 Kh5 28. Qg5#) 6... Kf4 7. Qe7 Rf5+ 8. Kd4 { Takes opposition, occupies the center } 8... Kg3 9. Qd6+ Kf3 10. Kd3 { take opposition } 10... Rf4 11. Qg6 { f2 only king move } 11... Kf2 12. Qh6 { Attack hanging rook, sets up cage } 12... Rf3+ 13. Ke4 { diagonal cage on e3 } 13... Kg3 14. Qd2 Rf1 { adjacent rosette, } 15. Qd3+ Kg2 { 2nd rank fortress } 16. Qe2+ Rf2 17. Qg4+ Kh2 18. Ke3 { attack the hanging rook } 18... Rf1 { opposite rosette, 3rd rank on the edge } 19. Qg5 Kh3 20. Ke2 { attack the hanging rook } 20... Ra1 21. Qh6+ Kg3 22. Qg7+ { fork } 22... Kf4 23. Qxa1 Kf5 24. Qc1 Ke5 25. Qc6 Kd4 26. Qd6+ Kc3 27. Qf4 Kb2 28. Qb4+ Ka1 29. Kd1 Ka2 30. Kc1 Ka1 31. Qb1# *


