{ With black to move, a simple procedure forces black to retreat. }
1... Rc7 (1... Rd1 { Give check with the queen until the checking square e1 is covered, then bring king closer. } 2. Qg5+ Kf8 3. Qf4+ Ke7 4. Qh4+ Kf8 5. Ke6 { threatening mate on h8. } 5... Kg7 6. Qg4+ Kh6 7. Qxd1) 2. Qg7+ Kd8 3. Qf8+ Kd7 4. Kd5 Rb7 (4... Rc1 5. Qf5+ Ke8 6. Qg6+ Kd7 7. Qg4+ Ke8 8. Kd6 Kf7 9. Qf4+ Kg6 10. Qxc1) 5. Qf7+ Kc8 6. Qe8+ Kc7 7. Kc5 Ra7 (7... Rb1 8. Qe5+ Kd8 9. Qh8+ Kd7 10. Qh7+ Ke6 11. Qxb1) 8. Qe5+ Kb7 9. Kb5 Ra2 (9... Ra3 10. Qe7+ { fork }) (9... Ka8 10. Qe4+ Kb8 11. Kb6 { cage } 11... Rc7 (11... Ra6+ 12. Kxa6) 12. Qe5 { pin }) (9... Kc8 10. Kb6 { cage } 10... Rb7+ 11. Kc6 Rd7 12. Qf5 { pin }) (9... Ra8 10. Qe4+ Ka7 11. Qe7+ Kb8 12. Kb6 Ra6+ 13. Kxa6) 10. Qd5+ { fork } *


